# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Never commit your actual .env file or hardcode API keys in source files.
#
# Quickstart (Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key for Prototyping):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required) and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
# 3. Click to generate/reveal your demo key.
# 4. Copy the key and create a `.env` file in this directory with:
#    GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=<your_copied_key>
#
# For production, create a restricted key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Time Zone API, Street View Static/JS API.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
